      "content": "it's just so much work to keep choosing to \"show up.\" it feels like i've lost all my agency. i'm just a passenger in this life now, watching everything fade. wouldn't it be more dignified to just... decide when the passenger is done? to actually have some control over the end instead of just waiting for my body to fail me?",
